ue\">$y=2x^2-3x+3$</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:150px;height:90px;\">[Diagram: 开口向上的抛物线草图，右侧]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"titleline\"><span class=\"green\">例题</span><span class=\"orange\">精讲</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue\">例1(1) 2020 福建厦门市月考</div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue row\">\n      <span>由二次函数 $y=2(x-3)^2+1$，则知（</span><span class=\"red big\">B</span><span>）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue row\">\n      <span>A、其图象的开口向下.</span><span class=\"red\">✗</span>\n      <span class=\"red\">$a=2&gt;0$ 向上</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue row\">\n      <span>B、其图象的顶点坐标为(3,1)</span>\n      <span class=\"red\">加对=3 （3,1）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue row\">\n      <span>C、其图象的对称轴为直线 $x=-3$.</span><span class=\"red\">✗</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue row\">\n      <span>D、当 $x&lt;3$ 时，$y$ 随 $x$ 的增大而增大.</span><span class=\"red\">✗</span>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:60px;height:46px;\">[Diagram: 小抛物线草图，右侧]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line red\" style=\"margin-left:210px;\">减小</div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue\">例1(2)</div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue row\">\n      <span>对于二次函数 $y=x^2-2x-1$，下列说法不正确的是（</span><span class=\"red big\">D</span><span>）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue row\">\n      <span>A、函数图象的对称轴是直线 $x=1$</span>\n      <span class=\"red\">加对 $=-\\dfrac{-2}{2\\times1}=1$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue row\">\n      <span>B、函数图象的顶点坐标为 $(1,-2)$</span>\n      <span class=\"red\">$(1,-2)$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line red\" style=\"margin-left:140px;\">当 $x=1$ 时，$y=1-2-1=-2$</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
